
sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as React Page or Component
    participant API as API Client
    participant MSW as MSW Handler
    participant Data as Mock Data

    User->>UI: Create a new task
    UI->>API: createTask(taskData)
    API->>API: Map camelCase payload to snake_case
    API->>MSW: POST /projects/:id/tasks

    MSW->>MSW: Validate request
    MSW->>MSW: Check authentication
    MSW->>MSW: Check project ownership
    MSW->>Data: Save new task

    Data-->>MSW: Created task
    MSW-->>API: 201 Created
    API->>API: Map snake_case response to camelCase
    API-->>UI: Return frontend task
    UI-->>User: Update task list

    Note over User,Data: Theme preference flow

    actor ThemeUser as User
    participant Shell as AppShell
    participant Provider as ThemeProvider
    participant Storage as localStorage

    ThemeUser->>Shell: Select Dark mode
    Shell->>Provider: toggleTheme()
    Provider->>Provider: Update theme state
    Provider->>Storage: Save taskflow_theme
    Provider-->>Shell: Updated theme
    Shell-->>ThemeUser: Apply Dark theme

    ThemeUser->>Shell: Select accent color
    Shell->>Provider: setAccentColor(color)
    Provider->>Provider: Update accent state
    Provider->>Storage: Save taskflow_accent
    Provider-->>Shell: Updated accent color
    Shell-->>ThemeUser: Apply selected accent
